https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis AND WHEREAS, Gutkha and Panmasala are food products in which tobacco and nicotine are widely used as ingredients now-a-days:
AND WHEREAS, it is expedient to prohibit Gutkha and Panmasala in the State of Tamil Nadu, being food products in which tobacco and nicotine are widely used as ingredients;
AND WHEREAS, consumption of the above such products will endanger human health and well being and whereas, if consumption of these food articles is allowed without prohibition the well being of current and future generation will be compromised and hence it has to be prohibited.
